        "text": "**A**\n\nBehind the veil of ignorance, I'd weigh the chance of landing at the bottom heavily. Society A guarantees a secure floor, and since I can't know my starting position, that protection matters a great deal. I'd give up some upside in B to avoid the real possibility of a harder life there.",
